Section 571.010 (RSMo): (14) "Large-capacity ammunition feeding device", a magazine, belt, drum, feed strip, or similar device that has a capacity of, or that can be readily restored or converted to accept, more than ten rounds of ammunition;
Section 571.020 (RSMo): 1. A person commits an offense if such person knowingly possesses, manufactures, transports, repairs, or sells: … (6) A large-capacity ammunition feeding device; or
Section 571.020 (RSMo): An offense pursuant to subdivision (4), (5), or (6) of subsection 1 of this section is a class A misdemeanor.
